{
  "name": "techreport-firestore-rules-test",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Tests des r\u00c3\u00a8gles Firestore (portion WORK 2) sur l'\u00c3\u00a9mulateur local \u00e2\u20ac\u201d aucun acc\u00c3\u00a8s au vrai projet.",
